        "data": {
          "comment": "# Five Headlines for a Landing Page\n\nWrites five headline variants for a landing page test. Each headline takes a stated angle, so the set differs in substance rather than in wording.\n\n**How it works:** \"Input\" takes a description of what the page sells. \"Agent\" writes five headlines under 60 characters, each from a different angle, and names the angle after each one. \"Output\" shows the list.\n\n**Try this:** Describe your own product in \"Input\", pick a model on \"Agent\", and edit its system prompt to require one headline that states a price."
